fluorine-desktop (0.4.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add flr-snapshot, which creates, lists, and rolls back Btrfs snapshots
    through snapper, including GRUB menu refresh when a snapshot generator is
    present.
  * Create a pre-update snapshot from flr-update before applying an upgrade
    whenever the root filesystem is Btrfs, and report the rollback command once
    the upgrade finishes.
  * Add a Snapshots action to flr-ctl that opens the snapshot table in a
    persistent terminal.
  * Depend on btrfs-progs and snapper so both tools are present on installed
    systems.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:10:00 +0530

fluorine-desktop (0.3.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add flr-ctl, a Fuzzel system menu bound to SUPER + Escape and the Waybar
    SYS indicator. It reaches nmtui in a floating window, the Bluetooth
    manager, wdisplays, the audio mixer, power profile cycling, the keybinding
    cheatsheet, a persistent flr-doctor terminal, and the lock, suspend,
    reboot, and shutdown actions.
  * Add flr-update, which refreshes APT metadata, lists incoming FluorineOS and
    security upgrades, runs the upgrade, and reports whether a reboot is
    required.
  * Prefer bluetui for Bluetooth when it is installed and fall back to
    blueman-manager and bluetoothctl.
  * Depend on pulsemixer and pavucontrol so the audio entry always resolves.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:45:00 +0530

fluorine-desktop (0.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add NetworkManager and Bluetooth controls to Waybar: the network module
    opens nmtui in a floating Kitty window and the Bluetooth module opens
    blueman-manager, falling back to bluetoothctl.
  * Add power-profiles-daemon integration through flr-power, with a Waybar
    status module and click cycling through power-saver, balanced, and
    performance. Systems without a platform profile driver report PWR N/A.
  * Ship a kanshi profile and autostart kanshi so external HDMI and DisplayPort
    monitors are configured automatically when docked.
  * Depend on network-manager, bluez, blueman, power-profiles-daemon, kanshi,
    and wdisplays, and install the flr-tui and flr-bt helpers.

